> So I just started playing a Knight and I was wondering if there is an
> advantage to riding my horse?

The primary points are: faster speed, greater carrying capacity, minor
damage bonuses at later skill levels, and the answer to the next
question.

> Also, if I want to use the lance I think I have to "apply" it to
> the enemy from a distance, right?

If you're on foot. While mounted, you can use it in direct melee as
well, and then there are special bonuses for successful jousting.

> Is there any way to charge?

